              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "lutzflcat"
            },
            "reviewBody": "4.9.17 Steamed the carrots in the microwave on high for 3 minutes, drained, stirred in the other ingredients, back in the micro for 10 seconds, and they went on the table. Knowing our taste preference, I did cut back on the ginger and brown sugar (sub’d Truvia® brown sugar), and with these changes, the carrots were delicious. Served with Instant Pot® Pork Chops and Gravy (on this site), mashed potatoes, and tomato slices with a provencale dressing.",
