              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Sheila Watson Hill"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Sooo good! I'm not a big fan of carrots but my grandson is! I added a bit more sweetness with honey. As strange as it sounds, I also added dash of vanilla. I prepared this part of my dish today. However, tomorrow afternoon I will be tossing the clazed carrots in coconut flakes and then putting under the broiler to toast. The recipe as written was GREAT! I just adapted it to my taste. YUMMY!",
